  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "A common problem in horizontal well production is erratic fluid surging. A result of these slugs is inefficient pumping and flowback into the formation. OSI has engineered a tool that turns the energy generated by surges into an advantage for the producer.",
   "box": {
    "x": 595,
    "y": 202,
    "w": 600,
    "h": 101
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The OSI ESP Surge Valve allows a fluid surge to flow one way through the valve then holds the surge above the valve, decreasing formation back pressure and increasing production.",
   "box": {
    "x": 595,
    "y": 328,
    "w": 600,
    "h": 76
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "ESP Surge Valve improves well profitability in both horizontal and vertical orientations. The system is applicable to many different lift applications, including electric",
